    {
      "type": "deb",
      "namespace": "debian",
      "name": "libdeflate0",
      "version": "1.23-2",
      "purl": "pkg:deb/debian/libdeflate0@1.23-2?arch=amd64&os_distro=trixie&os_name=debian&os_version=13&upstream=libdeflate",
      "author": "Deflate Team <libdeflate@packages.debian.org>",
      "description": "fast, whole-buffer DEFLATE-based compression and decompression\n The supported formats are:\n * DEFLATE (raw)\n * zlib (a.k.a. DEFLATE with a zlib wrapper)\n * gzip (a.k.a. DEFLATE with a gzip wrapper)\n .\n libdeflate is heavily optimized. It is significantly faster than the zlib\n library, both for compression and decompression, and especially on x86\n processors. In addition, libdeflate provides optional high compression modes\n that provide a better compression ratio than the zlib's \"level 9\".",
      "installed_size": 102,
      "locations": [
