      "author": "Nobuhiro Iwamatsu <iwamatsu@debian.org>",
      "description": "Fast LZ compression algorithm library - runtime\n LZ4 is a very fast lossless compression algorithm, providing compression speed\n at 400 MB/s per core, scalable with multi-cores CPU. It also features an\n extremely fast decoder, with speed in multiple GB/s per core, typically\n reaching RAM speed limits on multi-core systems.\n .\n This package includes the shared library.",
      "licenses": [
        "BSD-2-Clause",
        "GPL-2.0-only",
        "GPL-2.0-or-later"
      ],
