      "author": "Debian Multimedia Maintainers <debian-multimedia@lists.debian.org>",
      "description": "toolkit for RTMP streams (shared library)\n A small dumper for media content streamed over the RTMP protocol (like BBC's\n iPlayer high quality streams). Supplying an RTMP URL will result in a dumped\n flv file, which can be played/transcoded with standard tools.\n .\n This package contains the shared libraries, header files needed by\n programs that want to use librtmp.",
      "installed_size": 144,
      "locations": [
        {
          "path": "/usr/share/doc/librtmp1/copyright",
